    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rl31](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rl31) Magnitude 6.3 earthquake at 28.0 depth occurred on Nov 02 2025 20km NE of Marmul. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 36.5894 longitude 67.4843. It impacted 693651 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
